Registration Confirmed!

Dear <%= @tickets.first.attendee_name %>,

Thank you for registering for <%= @event.title %>. <%= @tickets.one? ? 'Your participation is confirmed.' : "Your #{@tickets.size} tickets are confirmed." %>

Event Details
- Event: <%= @event.title %>
- Date: <%= @event.start_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
<% if @event.event_locations.any? %>- Venue: <%= @event.event_locations.first.name %>
<% end %>
<% ticket_types_uniform = @tickets.map(&:ticket_type_id).uniq.one? %>
<% if ticket_types_uniform %>- Ticket Type: <%= @tickets.first.ticket_type.name %>
<% end %>
<% unless @tickets.one? %>- Tickets: <%= @tickets.size %>
<% end %>

<% representative = @tickets.first %>
<% ticket_payment = representative.ticket_payment %>
<% unit_price = (ticket_payment&.amount || representative.ticket_type.current_price).to_f %>
<% if representative.paid? && unit_price.positive? %>
Payment Receipt
- Receipt No: <%= representative.public_id %>
- Payment Status: Paid
<% if ticket_payment&.paid_at.present? %>- Payment Date: <%= ticket_payment.paid_at.in_time_zone.strftime("%B %d, %Y %I:%M %p %Z") %>
<% end %><% currency = ticket_payment&.currency.presence || 'MYR' %>
<% if @tickets.one? %>- Amount Paid: <%= currency %> <%= format('%.2f', unit_price) %>
<% else %>- Amount Paid: <%= currency %> <%= format('%.2f', unit_price) %> x <%= @tickets.size %> = <%= currency %> <%= format('%.2f', unit_price * @tickets.size) %>
<% end %><% if ticket_payment&.gateway_payment_id.presence %>- Transaction ID: <%= ticket_payment.gateway_payment_id %>
<% end %><% if ticket_payment&.gateway_response&.dig('order_id').presence %>- Order ID: <%= ticket_payment.gateway_response['order_id'] %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<%= @tickets.one? ? 'Your Entry QR Code' : 'Your Entry QR Codes' %> (attached to this email)
<% @tickets.each_with_index do |ticket, index| %>
<%= index + 1 %>. <%= ticket.attendee_name %><% unless ticket_types_uniform %> (<%= ticket.ticket_type.name %>)<% end %> — Ticket ID: <%= ticket.public_id %>
<% end %>

Please present the relevant QR code at the registration counter upon arrival.

<% if @contact_email.present? %>
Should you have any questions, please reach out to us at <%= @contact_email %>.
<% end %>
We wish you a wonderful and memorable experience at the event.

Warm regards,
<%= @sender_name %>

---
